{"t":"The Supreme Cube","s":"the-supreme-cube-e6fe9","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/The_Supreme_Cube_904d64.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">The Supreme Cube</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"The Supreme Cube\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/The_Supreme_Cube_904d64.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">10.00 oz</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Negotiable</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Updates%2F12.20.8834\">12.20.8834</a><br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 29, 2019<br/>Summer Update 2019</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20190707022355&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/The_Supreme_Cube_904d64.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see  the supreme cube.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 10.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">It's black and it's supreme.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>It's <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Cube\">The Cube</a> with its <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Missing%20Piece%20of%20the%20Cube\">missing piece</a>. When using it, two things may happen:\n</p>\n<ul><li>If you don't have a battle sign, you can <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Cube%20%28Location%29\">enter it</a>, as long as you have the quest requirements. You can then use it again while inside, and you will be teleported to <a href=\"#/wiki/Gray%20Beach\">Gray Beach</a>. This is very useful as a free teleport out of almost any location.</li></ul>\n<p>It is advisable to relog first and then quickly use the Cube, this way you won't get any damage from the Planedwellers. \n</p>\n<ul><li>If you're inside a House you own and have defeated the <a href=\"#/wiki/Planestrider\">Planestrider</a>, you can also Sleep (and offline train), but only once every 48 hours. When you do that, it will change into The Supreme Cube (Small).</li></ul>\n<p>There is a 2 hour cooldown to use the Cube, regardless if you accessed the Cube dimension or slept. \n</p><p>Part of the <a href=\"#/quest/opticording-sphere-quest\">Opticording Sphere Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bug%20%28Nostalgia%29\">Bug (Nostalgia)</a></li><li>Cloth Fragment</li><li>Cloth Fragment (Cube)</li><li>Floor Decorations</li><li>Functional Objects</li><li>Galthen</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Spider%20%28Nostalgia%29\">Giant Spider (Nostalgia)</a></li><li>Machines (Objects)</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Opticording%20Combinator\">Opticording Combinator</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/opticording-sphere-quest\">Opticording Sphere Quest</a></li><li>Planegazers</li><li>Prime Artefacts</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Quest%20Items\">Quest Items</a></li><li>Quests</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Spider%20%28Nostalgia%29\">Spider (Nostalgia)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Cube\">The Cube</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Cube%20%28Location%29\">The Cube (Location)</a></li><li>The Cube Effect</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Missing%20Piece%20of%20the%20Cube\">The Missing Piece of the Cube</a></li><li>The Supreme Cube (Small)</li><li>The Supreme Cube Carpet</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["opticording-sphere-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"opticording-sphere-quest","quest":"Opticording Sphere Quest","step":"9-2","n":63,"title":"Combinar os três itens","kind":"reward","coords":[]},{"slug":"opticording-sphere-quest","quest":"Opticording Sphere Quest","step":"10-0","n":65,"title":"Entrar na Cube","kind":"reward","coords":[]},{"slug":"opticording-sphere-quest","quest":"Opticording Sphere Quest","step":"12-2","n":99,"title":"Sair da Cube","kind":"reward","coords":[{"x":33189,"y":31982,"z":7,"label":"Scrutinon"}]}]}}